## 3. Fix

- New migration: supabase/migrations/20260917084341_vtid_03990_service_bot_accounts_skip_welcome_chat.sql
  - CREATE TABLE service_bot_accounts (allowlist)
  - seeds both offending accounts
  - CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION fire_welcome_chat_on_membership() adds the guard
- services/gateway/src/services/welcome-chat-service-repository.ts: added fetchServiceBotAccountFlag()
- services/gateway/src/services/welcome-chat-service.ts: added the same guard to sendWelcomeChatMessages()
- services/gateway/test/services/welcome-chat-service.test.ts: 3 new tests (see acceptance.md AC-1..AC-3)

