     CLAUDE.md/DATABASE_SCHEMA.md/supabase/migrations/** are out-of-remit per VTID-03696's guard,
     reported NOT JUDGED rather than rejected).

- drift (MIGRATION-DRIFT-CHECK.yml) failed: "table \"service_bot_accounts\" is declared ... but does
